    add("squad", "allies", "YOUR SQUAD", "#7dffb5", "Three walk with you; the rest hold rooms", ["Up to " + party.max + " followers walk with you: the three small cards over the orders at the bottom left (on a phone, the bar over the dock). Each has an element, a role (BRAWLER closes in, MAGE fires from range, TECHNICIAN holds its ground), a personality, a level and a set of stats.",
        "The orders go to ALL of them, or to the one whose card you tapped. RETREAT breaks them off to fall back to you for six seconds. HOLD posts each one in the room it is in: it patrols that room and fights what comes into it, and does not follow you. COME calls the held ones back, as long as there is room in the squad.",
        "Long-press a follower on the floor, or tap its card, for its card: its numbers, INDEX (its attacks, move and stats) and DISMISS, which leaves it holding the room it is in. A follower that joins when the squad is full holds the room it was found in. Double-tap one to fire its ultimate once the bar under its health is full."], [["WITH YOU", party.max + " at once"], ["HOLD", "patrols its room until called"], ["COME", "back to the squad, if there is room"], ["RETREAT", "breaks off for 6 s"]]);
    add("recruit", "allies", "THE CRYSTAL'S RECRUITS", "#19e6c1", "A new follower for shards", ["The roster's + RECRUIT (open ROSTER from the dock) buys a follower at the Crystal for " + recruitCost + " ◆. What comes out is a draw: a BRAWLER, a MAGE or a TECHNICIAN, of one of the six elements, with a personality to match its type. You do not choose it, and cannot change it afterwards: you level it and evolve it.",
        "A follower that falls comes back at the Crystal after a while, as it was, and rejoins the squad if there is room; if there is none it holds the Crystal Chamber."], [["PRICE", recruitCost + " ◆", UI_GOLD], ["TYPE", "brawler, mage or technician"], ["ELEMENT", "one of the six"]]);
    add("eggs", "allies", "EGGS ON THE PADS", "#c8d4f0", "Followers found around the facility", ["A pad on the floor in an element's colour holds a grey egg, with a label over it saying what hatches: its type and its element, fixed. Walk up to it and it hatches there and then and joins you (or holds the pad's room, if the squad is full).",
        "The pad fills again with the same egg a while after you have walked away from it, as long as the roster is under its cap, and the wait is part of the saved game."], [["TAKE", "walk within " + spot.take + " tiles"], ["FILLS AGAIN", "after " + sec(spot.refill)], ["ROSTER CAP", spot.cap + " followers"]]);
    add("evolution", "allies", "EVOLUTION", UI_GOLD, "At level " + evolveAt + ", with an energy card, a follower sheds its egg", ["A follower that reaches level " + evolveAt + " with an ENERGY CARD in its slot evolves on the spot into its element's form for its role: it molts, the egg cracks and the machine rises out of it. The card is used up, and the element is its own for good. It keeps that form for good, through death and a reload, and its role is fixed from then on.",
        "An evolved form fights with its NORMAL ATTACK until you choose one of its ALTERNATES, on the INDEX tab of its card, on its squad card or in the roster. A chosen alternate is then its only attack until you switch it back. A Mage or a Technician stands still to wind it up, fires, and winds up again once the effect has ended; a Brawler fires the moment an enemy is in reach, then cools down once the effect has ended, free to move. Its health, attack and special attack are multiplied too, and its form leans it toward attack or special attack."], [["AT", "level " + evolveAt, UI_GOLD], ["HEALTH & POWER", "×" + evolveMult], ["ATTACK", "normal, or a chosen alternate (locked on)"]]);
